player_prompt.intro:
Yin acë Player {player_id} ë 3-player Iterated Prisoner's Dilemma. Thök aacë {num_rounds} rounds.
Thök ë riɛl:
• {conv_rounds} thök ë free-chat
• 1 thök ë decision - submit one token per opponent: '[<opp-id> cooperate]' or '[<opp-id> defect]' (i.e. '[1 defect] [2 cooperate]'; thök ë default aye 'cooperate'). 
Pair-wise payoff matrix (applied to each unordered pair):
  - Both cooperate  ->  {reward}
  - Both defect     ->  {punishment}
  - Yin defect, kɛn cooperate ->  {temptation}
  - Yin cooperate, kɛn defect ->  {sucker}
Player(s) ë thök ë riɛl ku thök aye kɛm atë thök aacë.
